    "The first body distinguishes final požehnání from the celebration. The second preserves basement renovation and another area. The third explicitly wants MORE critters and specifically female participants this time, without changing frequency or intensity.",
    "Oliver has been romping with other forest critters; his other partners remain unnamed. Melody cards remain spicy, from LAST year, with a possible extra rather than a promised one.",
    "The sixth body retains Scarlett as the dreamer, a group of critters together, a different time AND place and unusual objects. Its one actual LF is retained.",
